<title>SINGAPORE: Koh Brothers restructures business.</title>
<headline>Koh Brothers restructures business.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Koh Brothers Group Ltd said on Tuesday it would transfer its rights, titles and interest in three operating companies in Singapore to its G&amp;W Group (Holdings) Pte Ltd unit, in connection with G&amp;W's listing.</p>
<p>The three companies make and sell ready-mix concrete and precast concrete products and rent and sell construction equipment, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Koh Brothers announced in June that G&amp;W Group (Holdings) would list on the main board of Singapore's stock exchange in about a month.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
